From e480cc4293a3e7d632802ae9fc88240b1faaed2e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adit <adit@example.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 03:01:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(skills): rebuild the diorama as a layered shadowbox
 matching the reference

One SVG layer per physical panel (back wall, Build, Motion, The rest, Systems,
frame) drawn in the reference's own pixel space, with real HTML over it for
text, tags, sliders and buttons. Pointer parallax by depth, a station filter
that recedes the other panels, the controller toggle pausing all motion, and a
full reduced-motion branch. Removes ~1,260 lines of now-dead CSS.
